# Model Routing

Use the cheapest capable model for the task.

## Continue / Local Models

Use Continue + Qwen Coder 7B for:
- selected-code explanations
- code review
- small refactors
- helper extraction
- type hints
- pytest generation
- duplicate code analysis

Use Continue + Qwen 3 8B for:
- local architecture discussion
- design tradeoffs
- second opinions
- planning terrain-aware systems

Use Continue + Gemma 4 for:
- alternative local second opinions
- comparing design suggestions

## Cursor Cloud Models

Use Composer 2.5 for:
- fast edits
- simple file changes
- small cleanups
- quick test generation

Use Haiku 4.5 for:
- cheap explanations
- docstrings
- simple questions
- lightweight summaries

Use Sonnet 4.6 for:
- normal Cursor agent work
- multi-file edits
- implementation plans
- reliable coding
- moderate architecture work

Use Opus 4.8 only for:
- whole-codebase architecture reviews
- major redesigns
- difficult debugging
- long-term roadmap planning
- high-impact decisions